@startuml
title UC03 - confirmed-commit receipt / CR-CAN-003 (REVIEW implementation)
autonumber
actor "CSKH application" as C
participant "Cancellation service" as S
participant "Operation / durable intent" as O
participant "Subscription root / slot" as R
participant "DB clock" as T
participant "Renewal / manual purchase" as W
C -> S : cancel(requestId, subscription, expectedVersion)
S -> O : authenticate caller; resolve key + canonical content
alt prior accepted / rejected outcome
 O --> S : saved terminal outcome
 S --> C : replay same outcome even after deadline
else different content / new ID when pending
 S --> C : conflict, no charge or refund
else new eligible request
 group TxA - persist pending intent
  S -> R : coordinate root, check expectedVersion / paid coverage
  S -> O : PENDING intent + observedVersion / observedCoverageEnd
  S -> R : pending intent guard blocks renewal AND extension
 end
 O --> S : TxA durable commit confirmed
 note over S,O
  If TxA commit unknown: lookup/recover same key first.
  Never infer rollback or invent receipt from HTTP/precommit time.
 end note
 group TxB - classify receipt after confirmed TxA
  S -> R : coordinate same root / slot and request
  S -> O : recheck already finalized outcome
  S -> T : obtain DB receiptCheckedAt
  T --> S : receiptCheckedAt
  alt outcome already terminal
   O --> S : preserve and replay original accepted / rejected outcome
  else version changed
   S -> O : REJECTED + FAILED version conflict
   S -> R : release pending guard, no charge
  else receiptCheckedAt < observedCoverageEnd
   S -> O : ACCEPTED + SUCCEEDED / acceptedAt=receiptCheckedAt
   S -> R : PENDING_CANCEL, cancelEffectiveAt=all coverageEnd
  else receiptCheckedAt >= observedCoverageEnd and no accepted outcome
   S -> O : REJECTED + FAILED CANCELLATION_RECEIVED_TOO_LATE
   S -> R : release guard; no retargeting or refund
  end
 end
 S --> C : HTTP only after TxB commit; lost response => lookup same ID
end
W -> R : check intent guard before renewal / extension
alt pending intent
 R --> W : temporary block; recover classification using current DB receipt
else accepted cancellation
 R --> W : no new renewal / extension
else rejected intent
 R --> W : normal eligibility re-evaluation, never retarget old cancellation
end
note over S,R
 Acceptance receipt is sampled after confirmed TxA commit.
 TxB commit may cross deadline without revoking an earlier valid receipt.
 A previously committed accepted outcome always replays, even later.
 Recovery after deadline without accepted outcome rejects as TOO_LATE.
 Accepted differs from effective: preserve all paid cycles until coverageEnd.
end note
@enduml
